            <p><b>How to create Click-to-WhatsApp Ads </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">is the question every business or marketer asks once landing pages stop converting. Traditional ads get clicks but force visitors to land on slow pages, fill out long forms, and wait for a reply. It leads to massive drop-offs and lost leads.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">That’s where ads that click-to-WhatsApp come in. Instead of sending visitors to slow landing pages, these ads bring them directly to the WhatsApp chat window with just a tap. It lets customers ask questions instantly, request pricing, book an appointment, or place an order without leaving the app.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Here’s a number that shows its results. According to a</span><a href="https://about.fb.com/news/2026/02/ai-fuels-indias-omnichannel-shopping-surge-meta-retailers-association-of-india/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Meta and Retailers Association of India (RAI) whitepaper</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, businesses using click-to-WhatsApp ads have seen up to a </span><b>62% increase in lead generation</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, a </span><b>61% improvement in return on ad spend</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, and </span><b>22% higher order values</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">. But the main question is how to create them.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In this guide, we will learn </span><b>how to create Click-to-WhatsApp ads</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> to generate more leads and drive sales by converting more conversations into customers.</span></p>
<h2 id="what-are-click-to-whatsapp-ads"><b>What are Click-to-WhatsApp Ads? </b></h2>
<p><a href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Click-to-WhatsApp Ads</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> are online ads that run on Facebook and Instagram. They allow users to start a real-time conversation by simply tapping on the “Send Message” or “Chat on WhatsApp” button. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Instead of sending customers to a website, these ads take them straight to chat where they can ask their questions, request pricing, or place orders. Ads that click-to-WhatsApp help businesses: </span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Generate leads faster</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Reduce website drop-offs</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Make customer communication easier</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Remove an extra step from the customer journey</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Increase conversions and sales</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A wa.me link waits for people to find your website or profile before starting a chat. CTWA actively reaches new customers on Facebook, Instagram, and even WhatsApp Status. Meta now even allows businesses to </span><a href="/resources/blog/whatsapp-status-ads-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span style="font-weight: 400;">run ads on WhatsApp Status</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">. This makes it one of the most effective ad formats for lead generation and customer acquisition. </span></p>
<h2 id="how-do-click-to-whatsapp-ads-outperform-traditional-ads"><b>How Do Click-to-WhatsApp Ads Outperform Traditional Ads? </b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Traditional ads often send users to landing pages where they leave without taking any action. Click-to-WhatsApp Ads remove the extra steps and allow visitors to have real-time conversations with businesses.</span></p>
