<li><b>Verified Phone Number: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">Your number should be active and available to connect with your WhatsApp Business account.</span></li>
<li><b> Facebook Business Page:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> A Facebook business page connected to your verified WhatsApp phone number with admin access.</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Note: If you handle a large number of leads, the API helps you automate</span></p>
